{"sha":"a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699","node_id":"C_kwDOTT80M9oAKGE0MjRlMGNlMDY4NjhkYzlhZDhmMTQyZjU3ZGU1OWI4ZjliNTg2OTk","commit":{"author":{"name":"egolearner","email":"jiliang.ljl@alibaba-inc.com","date":"2026-10-19T08:17:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-19T08:17:14Z"},"message":"ci(rust): run tests with nextest and stop per-commit release caches (#272)\n\n* ci(rust): run tests with nextest and stop per-commit release caches\n\n* ci(bench): drop the Rust candidate Cargo cache\n\nRetrieval runs only on pull_request events, so each saved Cargo cache stays\nPR-scoped and was never restored by another PR while consuming ~400 MB.\n\n* test(bench): expect no Cargo cache in the Rust candidate action","tree":{"sha":"e7cab88747a09292daf4a2330fb124b89936ae17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/git/trees/e7cab88747a09292daf4a2330fb124b89936ae17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/git/commits/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq1dIKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAquIQAK8ty0NesX+iFStzpQYcaRP2\ndTFFdWT+BIZdobc5cOAYQLixP3MyVQgPtqSSIm/JXd/JRQGt70TRAK6nebdJD7p1\nqgGayuUWNl+By7Q/qWO3at89DhmhNsYs/R9zX8EkU18moSumeyUUXez+6SI395xG\nbHbmEy8YMgc0xGk4uzKVAhzGvd6vWIEMegoPdb3B5fsZT1mutAavDRh8vmW8BMOS\ngVgMdNX/lQ8s8d/8LoK2j/jUbeK7niRKSk5Eue9ILFvgVS0s2/8C8JghaUpZvrgm\nsVVK6/Q1wFpc11S6Uy5XELt/rokgD+wbccfLV6He0ORf6l5BXhV4QSaR4d3dsjrZ\nZlDCHxaVQspOIGzdHfgChGvOJALEPDbIW704pwu6l5ok/npItxNoVXLAG7I1odll\ny/WxG59iAVtEkN2X0y6hlHUsm+oWesADo1Dkbxcm4kbdGwwU58gAPVMbhGu94Whd\nloMYmAxjilLb4UkRX6FE4iYmaGTSEYfICDNwQGysdZKUsepSUYzVX2yc+JOPTpi9\nFeBv6jTkYq2Srqy/TdeOMA/oMNI45sjFNq4LPjdeuvRdt0ImuY9V9Q8G4B1YNTLk\n6LYxW4h+tC8F0mLNeN/PfVm/RQ5h9wRRgYUHAtA6tG5B2KbCNAlvhRrv4rJhOuJC\nHsrly1Xy1g4ruAoni92E\n=rJeT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e7cab88747a09292daf4a2330fb124b89936ae17\nparent f2256bd3d7c560396b7f5a57b418426129d900c5\nauthor egolearner <jiliang.ljl@alibaba-inc.com> 1792397834 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792397834 +0800\n\nci(rust): run tests with nextest and stop per-commit release caches (#272)\n\n* ci(rust): run tests with nextest and stop per-commit release caches\n\n* ci(bench): drop the Rust candidate Cargo cache\n\nRetrieval runs only on pull_request events, so each saved Cargo cache stays\nPR-scoped and was never restored by another PR while consuming ~400 MB.\n\n* test(bench): expect no Cargo cache in the Rust candidate action","verified_at":"2026-10-19T08:17:14Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/commits/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699","html_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/commit/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/commits/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/comments","author":{"login":"egolearner","id":45122959,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTIyOTU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45122959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner","html_url":"https://github.com/egolearner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/egolearner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f2256bd3d7c560396b7f5a57b418426129d900c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/commits/f2256bd3d7c560396b7f5a57b418426129d900c5","html_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/commit/f2256bd3d7c560396b7f5a57b418426129d900c5"}],"stats":{"total":39,"additions":20,"deletions":19},"files":[{"sha":"d797211ffbfafaa7b54d4623f108937ddca3c76a","filename":".github/actions/rust-candidate-package/action.yml","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":13,"changes":16,"blob_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/blob/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/.github%2Factions%2Frust-candidate-package%2Faction.yml","raw_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/raw/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/.github%2Factions%2Frust-candidate-package%2Faction.yml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/contents/.github%2Factions%2Frust-candidate-package%2Faction.yml?ref=a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699","patch":"@@ -41,19 +41,9 @@ runs:\n       with:\n         path: ${{ runner.temp }}/rust-package-cache\n         key: ${{ inputs.cache_namespace }}-package-v1-${{ runner.os }}-${{ runner.arch }}-${{ steps.source.outputs.commit }}\n-    - name: Restore Cargo build state after a package cache miss\n-      if: steps.rust-package-cache.outputs.cache-hit != 'true'\n-      uses: actions/cache@v5\n-      with:\n-        path: |\n-          ~/.cargo/registry/index/\n-          ~/.cargo/registry/cache/\n-          ~/.cargo/git/db/\n-          candidate/rust/target/\n-        key: ${{ inputs.cache_namespace }}-cargo-v1-${{ runner.os }}-${{ runner.arch }}-${{ hashFiles('candidate/rust/Cargo.lock', 'candidate/rust/rust-toolchain.toml') }}-${{ steps.source.outputs.commit }}\n-        restore-keys: |\n-          ${{ inputs.cache_namespace }}-cargo-v1-${{ runner.os }}-${{ runner.arch }}-${{ hashFiles('candidate/rust/Cargo.lock', 'candidate/rust/rust-toolchain.toml') }}-\n-          ${{ inputs.cache_namespace }}-cargo-v1-${{ runner.os }}-${{ runner.arch }}-\n+    # No Cargo build cache: callers run on pull_request events, so saved entries\n+    # stay in PR-scoped caches that other PRs never restore while each one\n+    # still costs about 400 MB of the repository cache quota.\n     - name: Install the candidate's pinned Rust toolchain\n       if: steps.rust-package-cache.outputs.cache-hit != 'true'\n       shell: bash"},{"sha":"0932309e249f30942b029c84a8d3b1eac6f2530d","filename":".github/workflows/rust-ci.yml","status":"modified","additions":12,"deletions":1,"changes":13,"blob_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/blob/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frust-ci.yml","raw_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/raw/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frust-ci.yml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/contents/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frust-ci.yml?ref=a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699","patch":"@@ -100,8 +100,19 @@ jobs:\n           prefix-key: rust-ci-v2\n           workspaces: rust -> target\n           save-if: ${{ github.event_name != 'pull_request' }}\n+      - name: Install cargo-nextest\n+        uses: taiki-e/install-action@8cca0918f8471c33515202b73f56ab27f2bed283 # v2.87.29\n+        with:\n+          tool: cargo-nextest@0.9.148\n+      # The default Windows temp directory is on C:, which is much slower than the D: workspace drive.\n+      - name: Keep test temp files on the workspace drive\n+        if: runner.os == 'Windows'\n+        shell: bash\n+        run: |\n+          echo \"TMP=$RUNNER_TEMP\" >> \"$GITHUB_ENV\"\n+          echo \"TEMP=$RUNNER_TEMP\" >> \"$GITHUB_ENV\"\n       - name: Run workspace tests\n-        run: cargo test --locked --workspace --all-targets\n+        run: cargo nextest run --locked --workspace --all-targets --no-fail-fast\n       - name: Smoke test the CLI\n         shell: bash\n         run: ./target/debug/zg${{ runner.os == 'Windows' && '.exe' || '' }} --rg \"zvec-grep Rust rewrite\" README.md"},{"sha":"78f711bfbaf8f13fc0dce55494f0c2e5a1ebc41e","filename":".github/workflows/rust-package-build.yml","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":3,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/blob/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frust-package-build.yml","raw_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/raw/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frust-package-build.yml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/contents/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frust-package-build.yml?ref=a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699","patch":"@@ -57,9 +57,8 @@ jobs:\n             ~/.cargo/registry/cache/\n             ~/.cargo/git/db/\n             rust/target/release/\n-          key: rust-release-v2-${{ inputs.target }}-${{ inputs.runner }}-${{ hashFiles('rust/Cargo.lock', 'rust/rust-toolchain.toml') }}-${{ github.sha }}\n-          restore-keys: |\n-            rust-release-v2-${{ inputs.target }}-${{ inputs.runner }}-${{ hashFiles('rust/Cargo.lock', 'rust/rust-toolchain.toml') }}-\n+          # Per-commit keys would exhaust the 10 GB repository cache quota and evict Rust CI caches.\n+          key: rust-release-v3-${{ inputs.target }}-${{ inputs.runner }}-${{ hashFiles('rust/Cargo.lock', 'rust/rust-toolchain.toml') }}\n       - name: Restore the Windows ONNX Runtime\n         if: runner.os == 'Windows'\n         uses: actions/cache@v5"},{"sha":"f046a5db1bc6eca7f6d26a01e595c99a5d360fb5","filename":"benchmarks/zg-retrieval/test/workflow.test.mjs","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":2,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/blob/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/benchmarks%2Fzg-retrieval%2Ftest%2Fworkflow.test.mjs","raw_url":"https://github.com/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/raw/a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699/benchmarks%2Fzg-retrieval%2Ftest%2Fworkflow.test.mjs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvec-ai/zvec-grep/contents/benchmarks%2Fzg-retrieval%2Ftest%2Fworkflow.test.mjs?ref=a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699","patch":"@@ -291,8 +291,9 @@ test(\"the selected source is built from rust/ and exact-commit package caching b\n   assert.match(rustAction, /ref: \\$\\{\\{ inputs\\.candidate_ref \\}\\}/);\n   assert.match(rustAction, /path: candidate/);\n   assert.match(rustAction, /working-directory: candidate\\/rust/);\n-  assert.match(rustAction, /candidate\\/rust\\/target\\//);\n-  assert.match(rustAction, /candidate\\/rust\\/Cargo\\.lock/);\n+  // PR-scoped Cargo caches are never restored by other PRs, so only the\n+  // commit-bound package is cached.\n+  assert.doesNotMatch(rustAction, /candidate\\/rust\\/target\\//);\n   assert.match(\n     rustAction,\n     /\\$\\{\\{ inputs\\.cache_namespace \\}\\}-package-v1-\\$\\{\\{ runner\\.os \\}\\}-\\$\\{\\{ runner\\.arch \\}\\}-\\$\\{\\{ steps\\.source\\.outputs\\.commit \\}\\}/,"}]}